---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';

const h2 = 'mt-12 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-charcoal first:mt-0';
const p = 'mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.7] text-gray-muted';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — TBM"
  description="Terms of use for the TBM Ventures LLC website."
>
  <Section id="terms" padding="pt-section-mobile pb-section-mobile md:pt-section md:pb-section">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-text">
      <h1 class="text-[36px] font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-charcoal md:text-[40px]">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-muted">
        Effective August 14, 2026. These terms cover use of this website only — they are not
        the services agreement between TBM Ventures LLC and a client firm.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Acceptance</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        By using this website, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, don't use the
        site.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>What this site is</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        This is an informational and marketing website for TBM Ventures LLC ("TBM"), a
        client-acquisition partner for U.S. immigration law firms. The site does not process
        payments or bookings directly. Scheduling a strategy call happens through Cal.com, a
        third-party tool. Any actual engagement — the method, guarantee terms, pricing, and
        cycle targets described on this site — becomes binding only once it's set out in a
        signed services agreement between TBM and a client firm. Nothing on this site alone is
        that agreement.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>No legal advice</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        TBM Ventures LLC is not a law firm and does not practice law or give legal advice.
        Nothing on this site, or in TBM's compliance review process, is legal advice to a
        client firm or to that firm's clients. Client firms remain responsible for their own
        legal and regulatory compliance, including state bar advertising rules.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Use of this site</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        You may browse this site for its intended purpose — learning about TBM's services and
        booking a strategy call. You may not scrape, copy, or republish its content, attempt to
        disrupt or gain unauthorized access to it, or use it for any unlawful purpose. The TBM
        name, wordmark, and site content are the property of TBM Ventures LLC.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Disclaimers</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        This site is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Descriptions of TBM's
        method and guarantee reflect how the program is structured; they are not a guarantee of
        outcome for any particular firm outside the specific terms agreed in a signed services
        agreement.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        To the extent permitted by law, TBM Ventures LLC is not liable for indirect,
        incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Governing law</h2>
      <p class={p}>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Wyoming.</p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Changes</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after a change
        means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class={h2}>Contact</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        Questions about these terms: <a
          href="mailto:ben@thebenmount.com"
          class="border-b border-blue/30 text-blue">ben@thebenmount.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
